04600","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114153#issuecomment-3734204600","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114153","id":3734204600,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ek3C4","user":{"login":"onequid","id":49135017,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5MTM1MDE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49135017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid","html_url":"https://github.com/onequid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-11T07:55:48Z","updated_at":"2026-01-11T07:55:48Z","body":"A new trick found in this issue in v4.6-beta3 on Windows11. If I click \"Quick Load\" again without closing blank warning dialog. The dialog would turn into what it is expected.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f6c03645-3d47-489e-a0ad-c1271e918b2f","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3734204600/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3734339900","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114153#issuecomment-3734339900","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114153","id":3734339900,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7elYE8","user":{"login":"lostminds","id":17763524,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzYzNTI0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17763524?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds","html_url":"https://github.com/lostminds","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-11T09:59:05Z","updated_at":"2026-01-11T09:59:05Z","body":"> A new trick found in this issue in v4.6-beta3 on Windows11. If I click \"Quick Load\" again without closing blank warning dialog. The dialog would turn into what it is expected.\n\nInteresting and unexpected. Could this indicate that that issue might actually be related to window management during opening/closing of these warning message windows, rather than something specific to recursive resource assignment? In other words that if you open a warning message like this at the same time as closing/opening other windows (like the quick load dialogue) in some combination this messes up the loading or display of the warning message window? \n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3734339900/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3736556591","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114153#issuecomment-3736556591","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114153","id":3736556591,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7et1Qv","user":{"login":"onequid","id":49135017,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5MTM1MDE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49135017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid","html_url":"https://github.com/onequid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-12T00:47:03Z","updated_at":"2026-01-12T00:59:45Z","body":"I'm not sure as I haven't seen/tested QuickLoad with another warning popup. The other thing I forgot to mention is that clicking on Quick Load Dialog is disabled before the warning popup is closed. There's something wrong with the window focus and display priority.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/54344d06-de7b-4da2-bf9b-9998fe1699bf\n\n\nAnother issue seems more severe now:\nWith **Instant Preview** active in \"Quick Load Dialog\", recursive assignment would cause a **Segment Fault**, as it runs into a loop here:\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/e9bb99a3bbf69e117d8e8aafba70db31aefc34f5/core/io/resource.cpp#L633\n\n<details><summary>Screenshots while debugging</summary>\n<p>\n\n<img width=\"1329\" height=\"963\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a7141826-5cd8-4e15-8249-f01742851b0e\" />\n\n<img width=\"838\" height=\"1259\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/742c43e4-300a-4551-89be-e2adb517902a\" />\n\n<img width=\"1535\" height=\"690\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/52f68dde-5a87-4f95-95fe-f8e18329b1c4\" />\n\n</p>\n</details> \n\nReproduced in v4.6-beta2 and 4.6-beta3 on Windows 11 and WSL Ubuntu22.04\n@Meorge Would you have a look at this, as you are still maintaining this part? \nCC @KoBeWi \nSorry If the '@' cause any inconvenience to you.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3736556591/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3736784655","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114153#issuecomment-3736784655","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114153","id":3736784655,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7eus8P","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-12T03:47:46Z","updated_at":"2026-01-12T03:47:46Z","body":"Thanks for letting me know! I'll be able to look more into it tomorrow. None of the methods in the stack trace screenshots look like ones modified for Instant Preview, so I don't have any initial ideas as to what about Instant Preview specifically would be causing the loop and crash.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3736784655/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3736805218","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114153#issuecomment-3736805218","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114153","id":3736805218,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7eux9i","user":{"login":"onequid","id":49135017,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5MTM1MDE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49135017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid","html_url":"https://github.com/onequid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/events{/privacy}","received_eve